{
  "id": "R-7b1c2739e262abe5",
  "path": "/how-to-create-effective-promotional-videos-a-2026-guide/",
  "locale": "en",
  "family": "article",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Quick answer:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " To create an effective promotional video, hook the viewer in the first 3 seconds, focus on one clear message, keep most videos between 15 and 60 seconds, film vertically for social platforms, and always add captions since most video is watched on mute. Close with one specific call to action. The formula is simple: a strong hook, one idea, quick pacing, clear proof, and a single next step. Production value matters far less than clarity and a fast start."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Most promotional videos fail for the same reason: they take too long to say what they are about. By the time the message arrives, the viewer has already scrolled. In 2026, that window is brutal, roughly two to three seconds to earn attention, and the brands winning are not the ones with the biggest budgets. They are the ones who understand how people actually watch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This guide breaks down exactly how to create promotional videos that hold attention and drive action, from the hook to the length to the structure, with the specifics that separate a video that converts from one that quietly disappears."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What makes a promotional video effective?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "An effective promotional video captures attention immediately, communicates one clear message, and ends with a specific next step, all while respecting how short the viewer’s attention actually is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The old approach, high production value and a slow build, no longer works on its own. As the 2026 data makes clear, retention beats polish. Authentic, clear, human video that keeps attention outperforms flashy edits that take too long to land. A video shot on a phone with a strong hook and a clear point will beat an expensive production that buries its message."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Four things define an effective promotional video: it hooks fast, it says one thing, it is the right length for its platform, and it tells the viewer exactly what to do next. Everything below expands on those four."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why do the first 3 seconds matter most?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Because that is when the viewer decides whether to keep watching or scroll away. Research on short-form performance consistently shows the first two to three seconds are the moment attention is won or lost, and one analysis recommends spending 80% of your creative energy on that opening."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A strong hook interrupts the scroll. It can be a bold statement, a surprising visual, a question the viewer wants answered, or the most striking moment of the video shown first. What it cannot be is a logo animation, a slow fade-in, or a polite introduction. Those are the fastest way to lose the audience your video was made for."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A practical rule: lead with the payoff, not the setup. Show the result, the transformation, or the most interesting moment in the opening, then explain. If your video currently opens with your brand name and a musical intro, that is almost certainly costing you viewers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How long should a promotional video be?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For most platforms and goals, between 15 and 60 seconds, with the strongest performance often under 30 seconds. Length should follow your goal and platform rather than a fixed number."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A useful breakdown by purpose:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "ul",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "li",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A single problem and fix:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 30 to 45 seconds with one clear takeaway."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "li",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A product demo:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 45 to 90 seconds, showing the product in motion."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "li",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A fast pattern interrupt or myth versus reality:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " around 30 seconds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "li",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A before and after:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 15 to 45 seconds, built around the visual payoff."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "li",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Educational content:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 60 to 90 seconds can hold attention when the value is clear."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The guiding principle is to stop when your message lands. If it lands in 20 seconds, end at 20 seconds. Filling time to feel complete is a common mistake, and viewership tends to drop sharply after the 90 second mark for both B2B and B2C. Shorter, when the message is complete, almost always wins."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why should promotional videos be vertical, with captions?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Because that is how people actually watch. Vertical formats align with how users hold their phones and tend to outperform horizontal ones on mobile-first platforms, and short-form vertical placements now make up a large share of impressions on the major social platforms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Captions are non-negotiable. A large majority of video is watched with the sound off, so a video that relies on audio to deliver its message loses most of its audience. Add bold, high-contrast captions, and do not rely on a platform’s auto-generated ones, which are often small and easy to miss. Captions also lift completion rates, because they let someone follow the whole message silently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So the baseline technical setup for a promotional video in 2026 is straightforward: shoot vertical at a 9:16 ratio, add clear captions, and make sure it works with no sound at all."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What is the structure of a promotional video that converts?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every high-performing promotional video follows a simple three-part structure."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The hook, in the first 3 seconds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Interrupt the scroll with your strongest moment, a bold claim, or a question the viewer wants answered."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The message, in 15 to 30 seconds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Deliver one clear idea with quick cuts and concrete proof. Not three benefits, not your whole company story. One point, made well, with something that shows it is true."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The call to action, at the end."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " One specific next step, and only one. “Book a free consultation,” “message us on WhatsApp,” “link in bio.” A single clear CTA converts better than a list of options, which leaves the viewer deciding nothing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The most common structural mistake is trying to say everything. One video, one message, one action. If you have three things to say, make three videos."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How do you create promotional videos on a small budget?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You do not need a studio. The 2026 shift toward authentic, creator-style content means a phone, good lighting, and a clear message often outperform expensive production, especially for demos, testimonials, and behind-the-scenes clips that feel believable rather than polished."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The essentials that actually matter, in order:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Light well."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Natural light or a simple lamp setup lifts any video more than an expensive camera does."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Get the audio right."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Poor sound makes people leave faster than poor visuals. A basic clip-on microphone solves most of it, and record somewhere quiet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stabilize the shot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " A cheap tripod or even propping the phone on something steady removes the amateur wobble."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Script the hook and the point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Even a few bullet points prevent the rambling that pads a video and weakens it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Edit tight."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Cut anything that does not serve the message. Fast pacing holds attention."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For businesses that want the results without building the skill in-house, this is exactly what a "
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "a",
          "attributes": {
            "href": "/services-video-marketing-saudi-arabia/"
          },
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "video marketing service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " handles, producing videos designed for each platform and built around the hook-message-CTA structure that actually converts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How do you make promotional videos work in the Saudi market?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The same principles apply, with local specifics that matter. Saudi audiences are young, mobile-first, and highly active on Snapchat and TikTok, so vertical short-form is even more dominant here. Arabic and English both matter, and a video in the right language with culturally relevant framing will always outperform a translated afterthought."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Practical adjustments for the Saudi market: produce in Arabic where your audience is Arabic-first, add Arabic captions, and design for Snapchat and TikTok viewing behavior rather than defaulting to the platforms a Western playbook assumes. Promotional video works best as part of a broader "
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "a",
          "attributes": {
            "href": "/services-digital-marketing/"
          },
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "digital marketing strategy"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", where the video drives attention and the rest of the funnel converts it, rather than as a standalone post you hope goes viral."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How do you know if your promotional video worked?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Measure the metrics tied to attention and action, not vanity numbers. The ones that matter most:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hook rate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", the percentage who watch past the first two to three seconds. If this is low, your opening is the problem, not the rest of the video."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Watch time and completion rate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", how far viewers get. This tells you whether the middle holds up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Click-through and conversions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", whether people took the action you asked for. This is the number that actually reflects revenue."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Treat your hook like a KPI. Test different openings, track which ones hold attention, and when one wins, reuse its structure. The best video strategy evolves with the data rather than guessing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Common mistakes that make promotional videos fail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A slow start."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Opening with a logo, a fade, or an introduction instead of the hook."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Too many messages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Trying to say everything and landing nothing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No captions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Losing the majority of viewers who watch on mute."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Wrong format."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Posting horizontal video to vertical, mobile-first platforms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Filling time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Padding a video to a length instead of ending when the message lands."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No clear CTA, or too many."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Leaving the viewer unsure what to do next."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One video everywhere."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Cropping a single video for every platform instead of producing natively for each."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Frequently asked questions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How do you create an effective promotional video?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hook the viewer in the first three seconds, focus on one clear message, keep it between 15 and 60 seconds, film vertically with captions, and end with a single specific call to action. Clarity and a fast start matter more than production budget."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How long should a promotional video be?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For most platforms, 15 to 60 seconds, often strongest under 30 seconds. Match length to your goal: 30 to 45 seconds for one problem and fix, 45 to 90 seconds for a demo, and 60 to 90 seconds for educational content. End when your message lands."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What makes the first few seconds of a video so important?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Viewers decide whether to keep watching within two to three seconds, so the opening determines how many people see the rest. Leading with your strongest moment, rather than an intro, is what stops the scroll."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do promotional videos need captions?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Yes. Most video is watched with the sound off, so captions are essential to deliver your message. Use bold, high-contrast captions rather than relying on a platform’s auto-generated ones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Should promotional videos be vertical or horizontal?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Vertical, at a 9:16 ratio, for mobile-first social platforms like TikTok, Reels, and Snapchat, where vertical outperforms horizontal. Use square as a secondary format. Horizontal suits YouTube long-form and desktop viewing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do you need expensive equipment to make good promotional videos?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No. Good lighting, clear audio, a stable shot, and a strong hook matter more than an expensive camera. Authentic, phone-shot content often outperforms polished production in 2026, especially for demos and testimonials."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "strong",
          "attributes": {},
          "variant": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How many messages should one promotional video have?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One. A single clear idea with one call to action converts better than a video that tries to say everything. If you have several points, make several videos."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The bottom line"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
      },
      "variant": null,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Creating an effective promotional video is less about production and more about discipline: earn attention in three seconds, say one thing clearly, respect the viewer’s time, add captions, and ask for one specific action. The brands winning with video in 2026 are not outspending everyone. They are being clearer and faster."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "dir": "ltr"
